<title>SOUTH KOREA: SKorea July PPI up 2.6 pct yr/yr vs 2.3 pct yr ago.</title>
<headline>SKorea July PPI up 2.6 pct yr/yr vs 2.3 pct yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 2.6 percent in July, up from a 2.3 percent rise a year earlier, the finance ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>					 JUL 97   JUN 97    JUL 96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +2.6     +3.9	+2.3</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    -0.4     +0.2	+0.8</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 123.4    123.9     120.3</p>
<p>The ministry said the index rose 1.6 percent during the first seven months of this year, down from a 2.5 percent rise during the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
